{{!--
Third-party embeds on click (theme setting embed_consent, on by default; posts and pages only).
default.hbs puts a Content-Security-Policy in the <head> that forbids frames and scripts from other sites
(YouTube, X, Vimeo…) in the page: the browser never contacts them, whatever the post HTML holds and
even without JavaScript. src/js/embeds.js replaces each blocked embed with this facade; the reader's
click loads it inside assets/html/embed.html, a page of the site that has no such policy (YouTube in
privacy-enhanced mode, youtube-nocookie.com). « Always show » is kept per provider in localStorage
("attibling-embeds"), and can be taken back in the privacy panel (« Gérer mes choix », src/js/privacy/).
What the facade says follows the CNIL's conditions for a valid consent: who (the provider, named), what
(its servers receive the IP address and may set cookies or other trackers), for this provider only, given
by a clear action (the button; « always show » is never pre-ticked), as easy to withdraw (the panel, and
« Ne plus afficher automatiquement » under an embed shown that way); nothing loads before. {provider} is filled in by the script; the button's label depends on the kind of
embed (video, post, other). See docs/guide-auteur.md, « Vidéos et contenus intégrés ».
--}}
<template id="embed-facade" data-embed-frame="{{asset "html/embed.html"}}"
  data-label-video="{{t "Show the {provider} video" provider="{provider}"}}"
  data-label-post="{{t "Show the {provider} post" provider="{provider}"}}"
  data-label-content="{{t "Show the content from {provider}" provider="{provider}"}}"
  data-frame-title="{{t "Content from {provider}" provider="{provider}"}}"
  data-stop="{{t "Stop showing content from {provider} automatically" provider="{provider}"}}"
  data-stopped="{{t "Content from {provider} will no longer be shown automatically." provider="{provider}"}}">
  <div class="embed-facade" data-embed-facade>
    <div class="embed-facade__poster" data-embed-poster>
      <p class="embed-facade__provider pill" data-embed-provider></p>
      <p class="embed-facade__title" data-embed-title></p>
      <button type="button" class="embed-facade__load button button--l" data-embed-load>{{> icons/play}}<span data-embed-label></span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="embed-facade__consent">
      <p class="embed-facade__note" data-embed-note>{{t "Showing it loads this content from {provider}, which then receives your IP address and may set cookies or other trackers." provider="{provider}"}}</p>
      <div class="embed-facade__actions">
        <label class="embed-facade__always"><input type="checkbox" data-embed-always> <span>{{t "Always show content from {provider}" provider="{provider}"}}</span></label>
        <button type="button" class="embed-facade__manage" data-privacy-open>{{t "Manage my choices"}}</button>
        <a class="embed-facade__open" data-embed-open href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{t "View on {provider}" provider="{provider}"}}{{> icons/external}}<span class="sr-only"> {{t "(opens in a new tab)"}}</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>
<p class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" data-embed-live></p>
